{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/44543-2-5e-sidereal-charms-protection-against-shaping","id":44543,"title":"2.5E Sidereal Charms - Protection Against Shaping","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-07T16:57:47-08:00","id":44543,"title":"2.5E Sidereal Charms - Protection Against Shaping","content":"So, Sidereals are the splat that I know least about. However, I was looking through their Charm trees and I noticed something that I thought was odd. They don't seem to have a defense against shaping effects. <br /> <br /> Is that true or did I just blunder and miss something obvious?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1910-seconis","name":"Seconis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T17:04:33-08:00","id":44551,"title":"","content":"Yep, it's true.<br /> <br /> They have to dumpster dive into MA to get it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T17:48:51-08:00","id":44578,"title":"","content":"Sidereals have, in 2.5, Creation-Preserving Will, which protects from shaping.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11I0xCPgAS3ZhxGvTlBoePOuaDqgpyWs13jVKhJ4c8hM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Book of the Emerald Circle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/37100-white-elephant-for-flintlock-sidereal-custom-charms-and-discussion-on-themes\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Sidereal Charms</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sQxyi3ox0qn53c_vsUaVQi_pRdpKlQE50NT5ldQmxYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Expanded Sidereal Linguistics</a>","edited":{"userid":263,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","user":"Limited Reagent","date":". 01-08-2014, 07:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","name":"Limited Reagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar263_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T11:30:59-08:00","id":45731,"title":"","content":"Also they could just not be at the place when the shaping happens.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/744-korusef","name":"Korusef","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar744_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"510"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T12:04:35-08:00","id":45752,"title":"","content":"Tapestry.exe has crashed and needs to restart; FATE operation halted. Restart?<br /> call SidNotHere.cfg<br /> Patch SidNotHere applied, Tapestry.exe updated. Restart?<br /> Y","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u00e4! I\u00e4! Moe fthagn!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","name":"Valles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar280_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"677"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T12:09:17-08:00","id":45754,"title":"","content":"But it's crazy inefficient, cost-wise. It's instant duration, for one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/673-requiem_jeer","name":"Requiem_Jeer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar673_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T14:08:07-08:00","id":45840,"title":"","content":"Well, is Creation-Preserving Will crazy inefficient compared to the utterly ridiculously good Integrity-Protecting Prana that lasts a day? Yes. But I would consider IPP brokenly-good. Same with the other non-instant Shaping defenses, to be honest. Plus, 4m-5m really isn't that bad. How often do non-instant Shaping attacks really come up, anyway? Or ones that are less than 5m?<br /> <br /> Still, Seconis asked for Shaping defense, and Creation-Preserving Will is what Sidereals get. It's something at least.<br /> <br /> Oh, and I'll mention Duck Fate as well, as a Shaping defense, but it's a catch-all and even more expensive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11I0xCPgAS3ZhxGvTlBoePOuaDqgpyWs13jVKhJ4c8hM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Book of the Emerald Circle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/37100-white-elephant-for-flintlock-sidereal-custom-charms-and-discussion-on-themes\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Sidereal Charms</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sQxyi3ox0qn53c_vsUaVQi_pRdpKlQE50NT5ldQmxYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Expanded Sidereal Linguistics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","name":"Limited Reagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar263_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T14:11:21-08:00","id":45842,"title":"","content":"AK can also be used as a shaping defense... some times...<br /> <br /> *I know it's a perfect dodge and not a shaping defense, but it can be used to stop shaping attacks... and it's fairly cheap.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/258-thesarcasticsage","name":"TheSarcasticSage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T19:23:53-08:00","id":45999,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Requiem_Jeer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/44543-2-5e-sidereal-charms-protection-against-shaping?p=45754#post45754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But it's crazy inefficient, cost-wise. It's instant duration, for one.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's has the same cost as Sea Dissolves Herself and cheaper than Fond Remembrance of Adrian, but it's seem inefficient is due to IPP being broken as fuck IMO :'P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T20:40:06-08:00","id":46027,"title":"","content":"Fond Remembrance of Adrian is fuckin' cool, though - I don't recall any other Shaping <i>counterattacks</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T22:05:15-08:00","id":46070,"title":"","content":"Sidereals also have Fading Sun Form; Arms of the Unconquered Sun Style is really useful for Sids for shoring up their keyword defenses in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1878-adamantinerapier","name":"AdamantineRapier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1878_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T04:04:51-08:00","id":46164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/44543-2-5e-sidereal-charms-protection-against-shaping?p=46027#post46027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fond Remembrance of Adrian is fuckin' cool, though - I don't recall any other Shaping <i>counterattacks</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, Creation-Preserving Will (since it's an upgrade to Unwavering Well-Being Meditation) also applies an external penalty of (the Sid's Temperance) to a social or physical attack, gives you (Essence) soak if you still get hit, and with a repurchase can be used on other people! Being able to defend your friends against Shaping is pretty awesome, actually.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11I0xCPgAS3ZhxGvTlBoePOuaDqgpyWs13jVKhJ4c8hM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Book of the Emerald Circle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/37100-white-elephant-for-flintlock-sidereal-custom-charms-and-discussion-on-themes\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Sidereal Charms</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sQxyi3ox0qn53c_vsUaVQi_pRdpKlQE50NT5ldQmxYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Expanded Sidereal Linguistics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","name":"Limited Reagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar263_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T04:33:25-08:00","id":46173,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Limited Reagent</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/44543-2-5e-sidereal-charms-protection-against-shaping?p=46164#post46164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, Creation-Preserving Will (since it's an upgrade to Unwavering Well-Being Meditation) also applies an external penalty of (the Sid's Temperance) to a social or physical attack, gives you (Essence) soak if you still get hit, and with a repurchase can be used on other people! Being able to defend your friends against Shaping is pretty awesome, actually.</div> </div> </div> </div>That Willpower cost don't look so pretty though :'P And Temperance is the worse Virtue to have at 5, rolling everytime you want to lie as a Sidereal is........urrhhhhh.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T06:59:19-08:00","id":46224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/44543-2-5e-sidereal-charms-protection-against-shaping?p=46173#post46173\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> That Willpower cost don't look so pretty though :'P And Temperance is the worse Virtue to have at 5, rolling everytime you want to lie as a Sidereal is........urrhhhhh.</div> </div> </div> </div> Psh, that's why you have Avoiding the Truth, so you never actually have to lie. But really, you don't necessarily have to lie that much as a sidereal. The one I play barely ever lies. I'll partially agree about the Temperance, in the sense that I'd much rather have it like Temptation-Resisting Stance and allow for the use of other Virtues given proper circumstances.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11I0xCPgAS3ZhxGvTlBoePOuaDqgpyWs13jVKhJ4c8hM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Book of the Emerald Circle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/37100-white-elephant-for-flintlock-sidereal-custom-charms-and-discussion-on-themes\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Sidereal Charms</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sQxyi3ox0qn53c_vsUaVQi_pRdpKlQE50NT5ldQmxYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Expanded Sidereal Linguistics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","name":"Limited Reagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar263_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T07:15:08-08:00","id":46235,"title":"","content":"Suppressing a non-primary virtue (Limit and how clumsily it's handled is a different problem, which I agree is a bitch) is 1 willpower per-scene. You'll realistically recover that the first time you perform a social attack in which you tell someone a clever half-truth.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}